          "content": "A PEZA-registered enterprise received services that were treated as VAT-exempt instead of zero-rated. What is the proper VAT treatment, what documentary requirements apply, and what happens if the supplier used the wrong invoice classification?",
          "created_at": "2026-07-15T05:05:50.774872+00:00",
